# ing-software-group14

Welcome to the API documentation for *Mappatura Disservizi Urbani*. This API provides endpoints for user registration, accessing the user interface as well as 
the administration section of the webapp. Below you will find detailed information about each endpoint, including request and response examples.

## Group User
### Register [POST /SignIn]
+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "username": "exampleUser",
                "password": "examplePass",
                "email": "user@example.com"
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "redirect": "map.html"
            }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "wrong email format" or "wrong password format" or "email already taken"
            }

+ Response 401 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "username already taken"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "Internal server error"
            }

### Login [POST /login]
+ Request (application/json)

    + Attributes
        - username: `string` (required) - The username of the user.
        - password: `string` (required) - The password of the user.
        
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "message": "Login successful"
            }
            
+ Response 401 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "error": "Invalid username or password"
            }
            
+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "error": "Internal server error"
            }

### Logout [POST /logout]
+ Request (application/json)
+ Response 302 (text/html)

    + Headers
    
            Location: /login.html
        
    + Body
    
            {
                "message": "Logout successful"
            }
+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "error": "Internal server error"
            }

## Group Admin
### Login [POST /admin-login]
+ Request (application/json)

    + Attributes
        - username: `string` (required) - The username of the admin.
        - password: `string` (required) - The password of the admin.
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "message": "Login successful"
            }
+ Response 401 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "error": "Invalid username or password"
            }
+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "error": "Internal server error"
            }

### Logout [POST /admin-logout]
+ Request (application/json)
+ Response 302 (text/html)

    + Headers
    
            Location: /login.html
        
    + Body
    
            {
                "Logout successful"
            }
+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "error": "Internal server error"
            }

### Get Login History [GET /login-history]
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            [
                "username, dateTime",
                ...
            ]
            
+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Internal server error"
            }

### Get Registered Users [GET /fetch-users]
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            [
                "username",
                ...
            ]
            
+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "error": "Internal server error"
            }

### Suspend User [POST /suspend-user]
+ Request (application/json)
    + Attributes
        - username: `string` (required) - The username of the user to be suspended.
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Utente sospeso con successo"
            }
            
+ Response 400 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "L'utente è già sospeso"
            }
            
+ Response 401 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
               "Username non valido"
            }
            
+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Internal server error"
            }

### Get Suspended Users [GET /fetch-suspended]
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            [
                "username",
                ...
            ]
            
+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Internal server error"
            }

### Unsuspend User [POST /unsuspend-user]
+ Request (application/json)

    + Attributes
        - username: `string` (required) - The username of the user to be unsuspended.
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Sospensione rimossa con successo"
            }
            
+ Response 401 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Username non valido"
            }
            
+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Internal server error"
            }

### Get Segnalazioni [GET /fetch-segnalazioni]
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            [
                "Id, tipo, commento",
                ...
            ]
            
+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Internal server error"
            }

### Close Segnalazione [POST /close-segnalazione]
+ Request (application/json)

    + Attributes
        - id: `string` (required) - The ID of the segnalazione to be closed.
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Segnalazione chiusa con successo"
            }
            
+ Response 401 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "ID segnalazione non valido"
            }
+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Internal server error"
            }
   
### Get Feedbacks [POST /fetch-feedbacks]
+ Request (application/json)

    + Attributes
        - id: `string` (required) - The ID of the segnalazione to fetch feedbacks from.
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            [
                "username, commento",
                ...
            ]

+ Response 404

    + Body

            {
                "Segnalazione non trovata"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Internal server error"
            }

### Delete feedback [POST /delete-feedback]
+ Request (application/json)

    + Attributes
        - id: `string` (required) - The ID of the segnalazione from which the feedback needs to be removed.
        - username: `string` (required) - The username which wrote the feedback.
        - commento: `string` (required) - The body of the feedback.
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Feedback cancellato con successo"
            }

+ Response 404

    + Body

            {
                "Segnalazione non trovata" or "Feedback non trovato"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Internal server error"
            }

### Delete account [POST /delete-account]
+ Request (application/json)

    + Attributes
        - username:  `string` (required) - The username of the account to delete.
        - email:  `string` (required) - The email of the account to delete.
        - password:  `string` (required) - The password of the account to delete.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "Account cancellato con successo"
            }

+ Response 401 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "Credenziali invalide"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "Internal server error"
            }


### Check user session [GET /api/username]
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "username": "example_user"
            }

+ Response 401 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "Not logged in"
            }

### Retrieve segnalazione by ID [POST /api/segnalazione/:id]
+ Request

    + Attributes
        - id:  `string` (required) - The id of the segnalazione to retrieve.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "id", "title", "description"
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "Segnalazione non trovata"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "Internal server error"
            }

### Retrieve all segnalazioni [GET /api/segnalazioni]
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "id", "title", "description",
                ...
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "Internal server error"
            }

### Create new segnalazione [POST /api/segnalazioni]
+ Request

    + Attributes
        - tipo:  `string` (required) - The type of the segnalazione to create.
        - commento:  `string` (required) - The body of the segnalazione to create.
        - coordinates:  `string` (required) - The coordinates of the segnalazione to create.
        - gravity:  `string` (required) - The gravity of the segnalazione to create.
        

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                tipo: "Problema stradale",
                commento: "Esempio",
                coordinate: "11.1388","46.0769",
                gravity: "3"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "Internal server error"
            }

### Retrieve feedbacks for a specific segnalazione by its ID [GET /api/segnalazioni/:id/feedbacks]
+ Request

    + Attributes
        - id:  `string` (required) - The id of the segnalazione to retrieve feedbacks from.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            [
                {
                    "username": "Utente1",
                    "commento": "Example feedback comment",
                },
                ...
            ]

+ Response 400 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "ID della segnalazione non valido"
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "Segnalazione non trovata"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "Errore interno del server"
            }

### Create a feedback for a specific segnalazione [POST /api/segnalazioni/:id/feedbacks]
+ Request (application/json)
    
    + Attributes
        - id:  `string` (required) - The id of the segnalazione to add a feedback to.

    + Body

            {
                "username": "Utente1",
                "commento": "This is an example commento."
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "Feedback aggiunto con successo"
            }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "ID della segnalazione non valido"
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "Segnalazione non trovata"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "Errore interno del server"
            }